        {
            "id": "https://skullbuns.com/project-template-2.html",
            "url": "https://skullbuns.com/project-template-2.html",
            "title": "Cat&#x27;s Culinary Catastrophe (2D Animation)",
            "summary": "Cat's Culinary Catastrophe was made for a University assignment; I was tasked to create a 2D animated story for children.",
            "content_html": "<p></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Cat's Culinary Catastrophe was made for a University assignment; I was tasked to create a 2D animated story for children. The story I came up with is about a farmer who has different ideas for meals throughout the seasons, but keeps bumping into issues each time as their friends have to help out! </p>\n<h2>Media/Gallery</h2>\n<h3>Final Animation</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/uKPDQw12oA8\">Click here to watch the animation on YouTube!</a></p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"1\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/vlcsnap-2025-12-15-15h29m19s661.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/vlcsnap-2025-12-15-15h29m19s661-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>The cat first waking up from their snooze in their farm's hammock.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/vlcsnap-2025-12-15-15h27m50s492.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/vlcsnap-2025-12-15-15h27m50s492-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>The cat reaching for a egg their sleepy chicken has laid.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<h3>Storyboarding</h3>\n<h4>Spring</h4>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_1.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_1-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_2.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_3.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_4.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_4-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_5.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_5-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_6.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_6-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_7.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_7-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_8.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_8-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_9.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_9-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_10.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/Spring_10-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<h4>Summer</h4>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_1.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_1-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_2.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_3.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_4.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_4-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_5.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_5-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_6.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_6-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_7.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_7-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_8.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_8-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_9.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_9-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_10.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_10-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_11.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_11-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_12.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_12-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_13.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_13-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_14.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_14-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_15.png\" data-size=\"1280x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/SummerStoryboard_15-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<h3>Concept Art</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"1\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/AnthroFarmerFinalConcept.png\" data-size=\"3508x2480\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/AnthroFarmerFinalConcept-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"543\"></a>\n<figcaption>My second main character concept featured a clumbsy cat protaganist in a vibrant pastel-brushed world. I enjoyed this idea and stuck with it!</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/PixelArtCharacterSketch.png\" data-size=\"320x640\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/7/gallery/PixelArtCharacterSketch-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"640\"></a>\n<figcaption>My first main character concept was a more generic farmer character in a pixel art style.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<h2>Contribution</h2>\n<h3>Tools used</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Davinci Resolve (Video Editing, Animating camera + character limbs)</li>\n<li>Photoshop (Storyboarding, character sprites + backgrounds)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>My Role</h3>\n<p>As this was a solo assigment, I was responsible for creating:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A storyboard and the final animation.</li>\n<li>Animating the characters, which was done by creating a 'spritesheet' of each body part and combining them in Resolve.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Reflection</h2>\n<p>I was really happy with the animation both as a personal project and academically. It got an A or 70/100 grade and was also something I hadn't done before - 2D animation - which boosted my confidence in trying new projects I hadn't done before.</p>\n<p>I didn't get the full story I storyboarded done. This was somewhat disheartening but it reminded me that my time management skills needed work as I had spent a large portion of my limited time working on only the first season/quarter of the story.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
