        {
            "id": "https://skullbuns.com/ravine-level-design-project.html",
            "url": "https://skullbuns.com/ravine-level-design-project.html",
            "title": "Ravine Level Design",
            "summary": "My goal was to create a level iteratively for a third person shooter. I planned my level in Adobe Illustrator&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2>Overview/Goal</h2>\n<p>My goal was to create a level iteratively for a third person shooter. I planned my level in Adobe Illustrator starting with a node based diagram, then using a Melan diagram to ensure players decisions got them to different places in the map. I then used this to whitebox the level in Unreal, also utilising feedback from group playtests to improve on previous designs.</p>\n<h2>Media/Gallery</h2>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kv0KjwoVu_U\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/kv0KjwoVu_U\">Ravine Level Walkthrough Video</a></p>\n<h3>Final Screenshots</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/A.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/A-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>A Site</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/BlueLaunchpads.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/BlueLaunchpads-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>Blue Launchpads</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/C.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/C-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>C Site</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/RedLaunchpads.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/RedLaunchpads-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>Red Launchpads</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/RedSniperTower.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/RedSniperTower-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>Red Sniper Tower</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/RefinerCombatArena.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/RefinerCombatArena-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>Combat Arena between B &amp; C</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/ScreenShot00025.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/ScreenShot00025-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>B</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/TwinRockCombatArena.png\" data-size=\"1526x827\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/TwinRockCombatArena-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"416\"></a>\n<figcaption>Combat Arena between A &amp; B</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<h3>Diagrams</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/MelanDiagram-2.png\" data-size=\"1378x811\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/MelanDiagram-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"452\"></a>\n<figcaption>Melan diagram</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/NodeBasedLayout-2.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/NodeBasedLayout-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>Node based layout</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Work In Progress</h3>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/river_crystals_final.png\" data-size=\"872x615\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/river_crystals_final-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a>\n<figcaption>Making rapid prototype 3D models in 3ds Max</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/river_sightlines_crystal.png\" data-size=\"1404x842\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/river_sightlines_crystal-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"461\"></a>\n<figcaption>A top-down view with sightlines drawn on to show players can't see the central point from launchpad landings.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/ScreenShot00002.png\" data-size=\"1404x862\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/gallery/ScreenShot00002-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"472\"></a>\n<figcaption>A screencap with sketches showing my goal for the launchpads.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<h2>Contribution</h2>\n<h3>Tools used</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Unreal Engine (Whiteboxing, Blueprints)</li>\n<li>Adobe Illustrator (Diagrams)</li>\n<li>3DS Max (Modelling crystals and other decor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>My Role</h3>\n<p>I was tasked to create a level iteratively for a third person shooter. I planned my level in Adobe Illustrator: Starting with a node based diagram, then using a Melan diagram to ensure players decisions got them to different places in the map, and finally whiteboxing the level in Unreal using playtest feedback to imrpove on previous designs.</p>\n<h2>Reflection</h2>\n<p>I am pleased with how the level turned out both aethstetically and in layout. I talk about my thought process, feedback and changes on the<a href=\"https://github.com/uniglos/ct5016-assignment-1-ue5-6-lyra-level-design-SophWellDone/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Github Wiki</a> along with the source files.</p>\n<p>I recieved a 74/100 which got me an A.</p>\n<p>Aside from the layout, I modified the games jump pads into a long-range yet robust 'launchers' for both teams which was recieved very positvely. I also gained some experience with Unreal's blueprint system modifying this and other game mechanics like killzones and weapon spread.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  style=\"outline: 3px solid rgba(var(--color-primary-rgb), 0.55) !important;\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/playtest2_results.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1273\" height=\"523\" sizes=\"(min-width: 37.5em) 1600px, 80vw\" srcset=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/responsive/playtest2_results-xs.png 384w ,https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/responsive/playtest2_results-sm.png 600w ,https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/responsive/playtest2_results-md.png 768w ,https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/responsive/playtest2_results-lg.png 1200w ,https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/responsive/playtest2_results-xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
            "image": "https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/5/C.png",
